.espice 1
.title "The four controlled sources and a B source"
V1 (in 0) vsource  2V
R1 (in 0) resistor 1k
// vcvs: v(e) = 3 * v(in)
E1 (e 0 in 0) vcvs 3
RE (e 0)      resistor 1k
// vccs: 1 mA/V from in, pushed into node g
G1 (0 g in 0) vccs 1mS
RG (g 0)      resistor 1k
// The current through Vsense sets F1 (cccs) and H1 (ccvs)
Vsense (in sense) vsource 0
RS (sense 0) resistor 2k
F1 (0 f)     cccs 2 probe=Vsense
RF (f 0)     resistor 1k
H1 (h 0)     ccvs 500Ohm probe=Vsense
RH (h 0)     resistor 1k
// Behavioural source: any expression of node voltages
B1 (b 0) bsource v=v(in)*v(in)/4
RB (b 0) resistor 1k
.op
